  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have two springjoint balls that are exact copies of each other. When placed under the left index finger, it works great. When placed under the right index finger, it immediately 'flies off' like a super-bouncy ball and never comes back (unless I click Reset Avatar). \nThe ball is duplicated onto the other finger and given its own rigidbody, with the same settings as the other finger's rigidbody. I am seeing this on Desktop mode, 11/6/20, 1012. Other users on the beta see the same thing I do. Also seeing it on 2020.3.3p2 -- it is the same issue on both but hackspanner asked me to post it here as well",
